          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><hr />\n<h2 id=\"5-the-same-code-moves-to-dedicated-capacity\">5. The same code moves to dedicated capacity</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">This is the argument for starting on serverless rather than waiting.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">When your volume justifies committed capacity \u2014 dedicated endpoints, your own model, predictable throughput \u2014 the migration is the <strong>two arguments you already changed</strong>. Not a rewrite, not a new SDK, not a re-architecture:</span>\n<div class=\"language-python codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"c1\"># today \u2014 serverless, per-token, no commitment</span>\n<span class=\"n\">client</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">OpenAI</span><span class=\"p\">(</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">base_url</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s2\">\"https://api.inference.wandb.ai/v1\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">api_key</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">api_key</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\"># later \u2014 your own dedicated endpoint, same call sites</span>\n<span class=\"n\">client</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">OpenAI</span><span class=\"p\">(</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">base_url</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s2\">\"https://&lt;your-endpoint&gt;.inference.coreweave.com/v1\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">api_key</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">api_key</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Everything above this cell keeps working unchanged. That is the point: <strong>starting on serverless costs you nothing in rework</strong>, so the capacity conversation can take as long as it needs to take.</span>\n<h3 id=\"tracing-when-you-want-it\">Tracing, when you want it</h3>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Every call can be logged to Weave for traces, cost attribution and evaluations by adding one header \u2014 no code change at the call site:</span>\n<div class=\"language-python codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">client</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">OpenAI</span><span class=\"p\">(</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">base_url</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s2\">\"https://api.inference.wandb.ai/v1\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">api_key</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">api_key</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">default_headers</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s2\">\"OpenAI-Project\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"&lt;your-team&gt;/&lt;your-project&gt;\"</span><span class=\"p\">},</span>\n<span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Worth turning on early: it is how you answer \"which prompt change made this worse\" three months from now.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
